    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever since the anniversary of a young woman's death strange things have been happening at the White Oak Inn. Now, her spirit's roaming around, and an employee is receiving threatening letters. What dark secrets wait to be found? The clock is ticking and you, as Alex Hill, must uncover the truth before it\u2019s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25d8  Solve puzzles and interrogate suspects </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25d8  Find clues as you uncover the secrets of the White Oak Inn</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25d8  Enjoy a classic point-and-click adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25d8  Fully voice acted</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859200/extras/7cacb1a6a1fb1711bec84f10ebd9d31a.poster.avif?t=1743693980\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859200/extras/7cacb1a6a1fb1711bec84f10ebd9d31a.webm?t=1743693980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859200/extras/7cacb1a6a1fb1711bec84f10ebd9d31a.mp4?t=1743693980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Follow Alex in her story as she cracks the case!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859200/extras/6ddd6fbde99377633a186ff77b3d5651.poster.avif?t=1743693980\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859200/extras/6ddd6fbde99377633a186ff77b3d5651.webm?t=1743693980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859200/extras/6ddd6fbde99377633a186ff77b3d5651.mp4?t=1743693980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Solve puzzles and find clues in a haunted inn.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859200/extras/02102f2aef681f5448daed7cea83d166.poster.avif?t=1743693980\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859200/extras/02102f2aef681f5448daed7cea83d166.webm?t=1743693980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859200/extras/02102f2aef681f5448daed7cea83d166.mp4?t=1743693980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Interact with interesting characters as you discover whodunnit.</strong></p>",
